{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛\n舞台 あさひなぐ 中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"27公演あるのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あと26公演！」ってカウントしてたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「カウントしだすのがはやすぎる！」って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"國陵のみなさまに突っ込まれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと仲良いけど\n國陵ってつけると\n國陵のみんなじゃなくて\n國陵のみなさまって言いたくなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"國陵って高校の名前かっこいいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あさひなぐの漫画は読んでいただけましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あさひなぐの漫画を読んでから\n舞台を見ると尚更\n感情移入しやすいかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は漫画を読み終える前の的ちゃんと\n漫画を読み終えた後の的ちゃんの印象が\nかわりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日、的ちゃんになりますが\n的ちゃんになって思うことは\n的ちゃんは私の何百倍も心が綺麗で\n優しいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も的ちゃんくらいに優しい人間になりたいけどなれなさそうなので\n的ちゃんで居られる時間は\n誰よりも優しく気のいい不器用でいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は2公演！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼公演がおわり\n夜公演です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうあと20分で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、舞台とは関係ない\n楽屋の中でDOJIをしまして\n左足の親指の爪を剥がしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その足をかばって歩いてたら\n左足首やら左足の甲やらを痛めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日もがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2017/05/28/6138947/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}